            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A sole structure for an article of footwear comprises a first plurality of traction elements including a first series of directional traction elements arranged within a first annular zone in a first rotational direction around a pivot zone; and a second plurality of traction elements including a second series of directional traction elements arranged within second annular zone concentric with and larger than the first annular zone. The second plurality of traction elements is arranged in the first rotational direction around the pivot zone. The directional traction elements comprise blade cleats and wing cleats, and a width of each of the wing cleats tapers along the length from an intermediate portion towards each end.</p>
            </abstract>
